# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere. The images are built on
# Linux from this tree: a CR in VERSION, a Dockerfile, the Caddyfile or a shell script
# breaks the build or the runtime, so nothing is left to core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
